        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 227S, Modern Door Lever Latchset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe transitional design of this modern door lever has a very contemporary style. The squareness of the rose is enhanced by the sleekness of the 277S Lever. It is available in polished chrome, satin chrome, satin nickel, and oil-rubbed bronze finishes as either a passage, privacy, or dummy function. Easy to install, this leverset made by Omnia will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: <a href=\"/products/modern-door-lever-with-round-rose-omnia-227-00\"><b>Modern 227 Omnia Lever with Round Rose</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Door Lever Latchset with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 227S Modern Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-9/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationery door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationery door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/lcn-4110.jpg?v=1704442264\" width=\"342\" height=\"138\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Door Lever with Square Rose",
                "description": "Omnia 227S Modern Door Lever Set - The transitional design of this modern door lever has a very contemporary style. The squareness of the rose is enhanced by the sleekness of the 277S Lever. It is available in polished chrome, satin chrome, satin nickel, and oil-rubbed bronze finishes as either a passage, privacy, or dummy function. Easy to install, this leverset made by Omnia will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
